                <mxCell id="160" value="if not expiry mentioned in config file, then packags stays forever" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="149" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="400" y="450" width="170" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="165" value="&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;npm calculates the remaining expiry time of these dlx package by comparing cache hash folder creation time(file system timestamp) with the max-expiry-set in the config file&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="149" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="350" y="590" width="230" height="80" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="162" value="pnpm executes it from" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="149" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="140" y="460" width="170" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="167" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.25;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="1" source="96" target="149" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="171" value="&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;1. pnpm dlx: -&amp;nbsp; alias cmds&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;pnx, pnpx&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;When we dont want to install the package permanently, and using it temporarily&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;If the packages already &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 76, 153));&quot;&gt;exists in the store it will use that&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(153, 0, 153));&quot;&gt;else pnpm will download the package in sperate folder&lt;/span&gt; and&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 102, 102));&quot;&gt; not in the files folder&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Bydefualt&amp;nbsp; dlx packags expiry time is 24hrs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;we can modify this defualt expiry time via config file&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;pnpm creates a temporary hash named folder for this dlx package at ~/.cache/pnpm/dlx, this hash folder contains the package.json file with its package name&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;packages building/linking of these packages happens at (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(204, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Bin file of these packages are (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(204, 0, 0));&quot;&gt;pending&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;Pnpm calculates the remaining expiry time of these dlx package by comparing cache hash folder creation time(file system timestamp) with the max-expiry-set in the config file&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;The meta data of these packages are store in ~/.cache/pnpm/dlx folder&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="2020" y="520" width="460" height="300" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="176" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="174" target="177">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint x="2350" y="300" as="targetPoint"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="174" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background-color: rgb(18, 19, 20); font-family: &amp;quot;Droid Sans Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19px; white-space: pre; color: rgb(187, 190, 191);&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(187, 190, 191), rgb(73, 75, 76));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 231, 135);&quot;&gt;storeDir&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(187, 190, 191);&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(165, 214, 255);&quot;&gt;&quot;/home/karan/.local/share/pnpm/store/v11&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(187, 190, 191);&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(187, 190, 191), rgb(73, 75, 76));&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(187, 190, 191);&quot;&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(126, 231, 135);&quot;&gt;&quot;virtualStoreDir&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(187, 190, 191);&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(165, 214, 255);&quot;&gt;&quot;../../../../../../.local/share/pnpm/store/v11/links&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(187, 190, 191);&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
